# Who approves changes to this policy repo (D30, D33). Turn on branch protection for the
# default branch with "Require review from Code Owners", so these owners are required.
# The last matching line wins. EDIT: replace the example handles with your org's teams.

# Everything not named below - the org policy, agents, pipelines and skills catalog -
# belongs to the org admins.
*                                @your-org/agentic-org-admins
/policy/                         @your-org/agentic-org-admins
/agents/                         @your-org/agentic-org-admins
/pipelines/                      @your-org/agentic-org-admins
/skills/                         @your-org/agentic-org-admins
/CODEOWNERS                      @your-org/agentic-org-admins
/.github/                        @your-org/agentic-org-admins

# One block per team: its layer (agents, pipelines with per-repo overlays, skills) is the
# team leads'. Its narrowing of org policy is the leads' or the org admins' (a team file
# can only narrow; the loader refuses anything wider).
/teams/payments/                 @your-org/payments-leads
/policy/teams/payments.yaml      @your-org/payments-leads @your-org/agentic-org-admins
